{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_01",
      "hash": "76a38f0c21048f9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_02",
      "hash": "76a38c0c21048a84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "終於追上[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！\\c\\n我也拿到綠色徽章囉！\\c\\n這樣一來\\n我也能去寶可夢聯盟了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_03",
      "hash": "76a38d0c21048c37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我聽別人說\\n四天王的實力強得不得了……\\c\\n但我們非去挑戰不可對吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_06",
      "hash": "76a3880c210483b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的決心\\n堅定到什麼程度呢？\\c\\n就讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳培育的寶可夢\\n來告訴我吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_04",
      "hash": "76a38a0c2104871e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我從小就一直在想，\\n自己一定要給[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\r\\n當個好榜樣才行。\\c\\n但我發現，\\n在訓練家的才能這方面，\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳其實遠遠在我之上……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_05",
      "hash": "76a38b0c210488d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這是我第一次體會到\\n不甘心的滋味。\\c\\n大概是因為我\\n太喜歡寶可夢了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_07",
      "hash": "76a3890c2104856b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我無論如何都還不想\\n承認自己輸給了[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_08",
      "hash": "76a3860c21048052",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我知道這樣看起來很傻，\\n但這次就讓我先走一步吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p05_field_r022",
      "hash": "da4688279a72feb1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p06_field_r022",
      "hash": "020d30839e4eb4b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
